        <li><h3>Brush with the fibres</h3><p>A soft brush, moving the way the mohair lies, keeps the coat full.</p></li>
        <li><h3>Keep out of long sun</h3><p>Hand-dyed wools stay rich when they aren't left on a sunny windowsill all summer.</p></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="section-head" style="margin-bottom:34px"><h2>Questions about adopting</h2></div>
