        <details><summary>When will my bear arrive?</summary><p>Every bear is packed by hand. We email you as soon as yours is on its way.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Is each bear really one of a kind?</summary><p>Yes. Bears are made in small batches and never repeated exactly, so the bear you pick is the one you receive.</p></details>
